---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/RealestateLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Toronto Real Estate | Neighbourhood Profile | Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent"
  description="Toronto neighbourhood profile covering downtown, midtown, east end, and west end. Housing types, price ranges, transit, schools, and market insights from Cory Wong."
  canonicalPath="/neighbourhoods/toronto"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">Toronto</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__subtitle">Neighbourhood Profile</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Profile Content -->
  <article class="profile">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <div class="profile__intro">
        <p>
          Toronto is the GTA's largest and most segmented real estate market. Each area &mdash;
          downtown, midtown, east end, west end &mdash; has its own character, housing stock,
          and price dynamics. Understanding the differences between these pockets is essential
          for making a sound buying or selling decision.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Character and Feel -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Character and Feel</h2>
        <p>
          Downtown Toronto is dense, walkable, and condo-dominant, with a mix of historic
          neighbourhoods and glass towers. Midtown offers tree-lined streets with a mix of
          detached homes, semis, and low-rise condos. The east end &mdash; from Leslieville
          through the Danforth to Scarborough &mdash; has become one of the city's most active
          markets for young families seeking freehold homes. The west end, from Parkdale through
          High Park to Etobicoke, offers a similar mix with slightly different price points and
          community character.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Who Buys -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Who Buys in Toronto</h2>
        <p>
          The buyer profile varies significantly by area. First-time buyers often enter through
          the condo market downtown or in emerging neighbourhoods. Move-up buyers look for
          freehold properties &mdash; semis, towns, and detached homes &mdash; in midtown, the
          east end, and the west end. Investors remain active in the condo segment, particularly
          near transit and post-secondary institutions.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Housing Types and Price Ranges -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Housing Types and Price Ranges</h2>
        <ul class="profile__price-list">
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Detached (central Toronto)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$1.5M &ndash; $3.5M+</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Detached (east/west end)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$1.1M &ndash; $2M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Semi-detached and townhomes</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$900K &ndash; $1.6M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Condos (downtown)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">$500K &ndash; $1.2M</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="profile__price-label">Condos (outer areas)</span>
            <span class="profile__price-value">From $450K</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="profile__price-disclaimer">
          These are general estimates based on market activity in early 2026. Actual prices
          vary by property. Speak with Cory for a current assessment.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Transit and Highways -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Transit and Highways</h2>
        <p>
          Toronto has the GTA's most extensive transit network. The TTC operates subway,
          streetcar, and bus routes across the city. GO Transit's Union Station hub connects
          to all regional rail lines. The Eglinton Crosstown LRT is coming online, adding
          rapid transit along Eglinton Avenue and improving connectivity between midtown and
          the east end.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Amenities and Schools -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Amenities and Schools</h2>
        <p>
          Toronto offers unmatched urban amenities: major hospitals (SickKids, Mount Sinai,
          St. Michael's, Sunnybrook), the University of Toronto, and a cultural scene that
          includes the ROM, AGO, and dozens of neighbourhood-level arts and dining
          destinations.
        </p>
        <p>
          Schools are managed by the Toronto District School Board (TDSB) and the Toronto
          Catholic District School Board (TCDSB). Demand in top public school catchment areas
          directly affects home prices &mdash; properties within sought-after school boundaries
          carry a measurable premium.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Real Estate Perspective -->
      <section class="profile__section">
        <h2 class="profile__section-title">Real Estate Perspective</h2>
        <p>
          The condo segment has softened, creating genuine opportunity for buyers who have been
          priced out in previous years. Inventory is elevated and sellers are more willing to
          negotiate. Freehold properties remain resilient, particularly in established
          neighbourhoods with good schools and transit access. For sellers, accurate pricing
          is critical &mdash; overpriced listings are sitting longer than they have in years.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <div class="profile__cta">
        <a href="/contact" class="cta cta--primary">Discuss Toronto Real Estate with Cory</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Compliance -->
      <div class="profile__compliance">
        <p>
          Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent. Real estate services provided through Trustwell
          Realty Inc., Brokerage. Information is believed to be accurate but is not guaranteed.
          Speak with Cory for advice specific to your situation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <!-- Newsletter -->
  <section class="newsletter">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="newsletter__heading">Stay Informed</h2>
      <p class="newsletter__text">
        Get monthly market data, neighbourhood insights, and practical advice for buyers
        and sellers across the Greater Toronto Area.
      </p>
      <form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter__form" novalidate>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="newsletter-email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          class="newsletter__input"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary newsletter__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p id="newsletter-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  const newsletterForm = document.getElementById('newsletter-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const newsletterStatus = document.getElementById('newsletter-form-status');

  if (newsletterForm && newsletterStatus) {
    newsletterForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      newsletterStatus.textContent = '';
      newsletterStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(newsletterForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'newsletter',
        email: formData.get('email'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          newsletterStatus.textContent = 'You\'re subscribed! Watch your inbox for the next report.';
          newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          newsletterForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        newsletterStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .content-narrow {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .page-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* Profile */
  .profile {
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .profile__intro {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__intro p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .profile__section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .profile__section-title {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* Price List */
  .profile__price-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .profile__price-list li:first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__price-label {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .profile__price-value {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: right;
    padding-left: var(--space-md);
  }

  .profile__price-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* CTA */
  .profile__cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding-top: var(--space-xl);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* Compliance */
  .profile__compliance {
    margin-top: var(--space-lg);
    padding-top: var(--space-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .profile__compliance p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .newsletter {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .newsletter__heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .newsletter__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .newsletter__input {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .newsletter__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .newsletter__btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .newsletter__btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    min-height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--success {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--error {
    color: #fecaca;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .profile__price-list li {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: var(--space-xs);
    }

    .profile__price-value {
      text-align: left;
      padding-left: 0;
    }

    .newsletter__form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
